  "Deal <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Fire damage to all foes, decrease the target's DEF based on $2 own Ailment ACC, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> for $5 turns, additionally decrease DEF by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> when taking Fire, Elec, Ice, and Wind damage. There is a $6 base chance to inflict Burn. gain [Warm Welcome]. (Cannot stack the DEF Down effect with [Intimidate Baddie].)\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Chatter! Bad guys who did something bad, this is your punishment, eat my slap!</color></size></b>": "",
